{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/yubikit\/loggingguide"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"YubiKit"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"Logging"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/LoggingGuide"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Choose YubiKit’s log level and backend with "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/Logs\/configure(logLevel:factory:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"article","seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/Logs"],"title":"Preparing your project","anchor":"Preparing-your-project"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No setup is required. YubiKit defaults to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"debug"},{"type":"text","text":" on stdout when compiled with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DEBUG"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"info"},{"type":"text","text":" on stderr otherwise. You can override either default:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import YubiKit","import Logging","","\/\/ Show warnings and errors.","YubiKit.Logs.configure(logLevel: .warning)","","\/\/ Use your preferred backend.","YubiKit.Logs.configure(logLevel: .debug) { label in","    StreamLogHandler.standardOutput(label: label)","}","","\/\/ Turn logging off.","YubiKit.Logs.configure { _ in SwiftLogNoOpLogHandler() }","","\/\/ Restore defaults.","YubiKit.Logs.configure()"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","in